    "declared_adaptation": "The SAE reconstructs its input and AuxK reconstructs its reconstruction residual. A transformer MLP has no such reconstruction target. This study instead uses a zero-forward ghost path whose parameter gradients receive the downstream language-model cotangent; it is paper-inspired, not literal AuxK."
